  "generatedAt": "2026-10-05T02:11:21.263Z",
  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "Adds a whole review subsystem to osf: a lens catalogue (20 shipped lenses plus repository overrides), a reviewer roster driven by `[agents]` in osf.toml, per-reviewer headless runs in a clean copy of the change, quote-verified answers, a deterministic reducer that decides a verdict, and a new `review.yml` workflow that builds osf from the base branch, runs codex/claude/opencode each with only its own key, then reduces and posts. It also reworks suppression ownership in osf-lint-core, adds `--no-suppress` to `osf scan`, and moves process-tree killing into a shared module.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
